    <div class="future-v1__guide-compare-table" role="table" aria-label="Open-cell and closed-cell conversation guide"><div role="row"><strong role="columnheader">Open-cell</strong><span role="cell">Often discussed for cavities and irregular framing where air sealing is part of the project conversation.</span><a href="/future/open-cell-spray-foam-insulation">Read overview <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></div><div role="row"><strong role="columnheader">Closed-cell</strong><span role="cell">Often discussed where cavity depth, assembly conditions, and moisture-resistant characteristics need review.</span><a href="/future/closed-cell-spray-foam-insulation">Read overview <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a></div></div>
  </section>
</section>
